%
O0050 (APSD-MILLING-1 - OP 50 PIN MACHINING)

N10 G21 G17 G90 G40 G49 G80 G94
N20 G54
N30 T03 M06
N40 S4000 M03
N50 G00 G43 H03 Z10

(TOP SURFACE AND SIX PINS)
N60 #100=-2
N70 WHILE [#100 GE -4] DO1
N80 #101=0
N90 WHILE [#101 LE 85] DO2
N100 #102=0
N110 #103=0
N120 WHILE [#103 LT 6] DO3
N130 M98 P1001
N140 #103=#103+1
N150 END3
N160 #106=170
N170 M98 P1002
N180 #101=#101+2.5
N190 END2

(PIN CONTOUR PASSES)
N200 #103=0
N210 WHILE [#103 LT 6] DO2
N220 M98 P1003
N230 G00 X[#104+4.75] Y#105
N240 G01 Z#100 F60
N250 G03 X[#104-4.75] I-4.75 J0 F150
N260 G03 X[#104+4.75] I4.75 J0
N270 G00 Z10
N280 #103=#103+1
N290 END2
N300 #100=#100-2
N310 END1

(END OF MAIN PROGRAM)
N320 G00 Z10
N330 M05
N340 G49
N350 M30

(SUBPROGRAM - PIN EXCLUSION)
O1001
N820 M98 P1003
N830 #109=[4.75*4.75-[#101-#105]*[#101-#105]]
N840 IF [#109 LE 0] GOTO 901
N850 #110=SQRT[#109]
N860 #106=[#104-#110]
N870 M98 P1002
N880 #102=[#104+#110]
N901 M99

(SUBPROGRAM - RASTER SEGMENT)
O1002
N890 IF [#106 LE #102] GOTO 905
N900 G00 Z10
N910 G00 X#102 Y#101
N920 G01 Z#100 F60
N930 G01 X#106 F150
N940 G00 Z10
N905 M99

(SUBPROGRAM - SORTED PIN CENTRES)
O1003
N950 #104=20.081
N960 #105=28.5
N970 IF [#103 EQ 0] GOTO 903
N980 #105=51.5
N990 IF [#103 EQ 1] GOTO 903
N1000 #104=40
N1010 #105=17
N1020 IF [#103 EQ 2] GOTO 903
N1030 #105=63
N1040 IF [#103 EQ 3] GOTO 903
N1050 #104=59.919
N1060 #105=28.5
N1070 IF [#103 EQ 4] GOTO 903
N1080 #105=51.5
N903 #105=#105
N1090 M99
%